  "content": "\n\n<p>本模组为《我的世界》中各类装备的悬浮提示添加了额外的工具属性。该模组支持自定义配置，允许禁用部分信息。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>当前功能</p>\n<ul>\n<li>采集等级（仅适用于镐等分级物品）</li>\n<li>挖掘效率（仅适用于镐等分级物品）</li>\n<li>附魔能力（在附魔台界面时显示于所有可附魔物品上）</li>\n<li>工具耐久度（工具受损时显示）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/287/441/screenshot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>喜欢这个模组并希望支持我？</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/DarkhaxDev\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a> 上关注我</li>\n<li>加入我的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></li>\n<li>在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 上赞助我</li>\n<li>访问我的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">网站</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://nodecraft.com/r/darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://nodecraft.com/assets/images/logo-dark.png\" width=\"384\" height=\"90\"></a><br>本项目由 Nodecraft 赞助。使用优惠码&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://nodecraft.com/r/darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Darkhax</a>&nbsp;可在首月服务中享受 30% 折扣！<img src=\"https://skulk.blmj.red/tool-stats\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>图标由 Game Icons 网站的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgame-icons.net%252f1x1%252florc%252fsword-spade.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lorc</a>&nbsp;制作，遵循 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC By 3.0</a> 许可协议。</p>",
